<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 02:46:19 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>白天也能施展魔法</title><link>https://some.pics/6af133f8dc0d1</link><description>&lt;p&gt;白天也是施展巫术的好时机。如果深夜让你疲惫，你可以在早餐后念诵咒语，或在下午制作护身符。你不必为了腾出时间进行修炼而牺牲睡眠。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted storybook witch braiding a charm in a sunlit conservatory atop an enormous brown tortoise, surrounded by ferns, rose-pink cushions, and charcoal window frames, with ivory serif lettering above and a gold emblem at bottom-right. Text: Daylight is a good time for witchcraft, too. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af133f8dc0d1.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 02:46:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>海龟</title><link>https://some.pics/6af10c064c98a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;乌龟&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Six turtles resting on rocks in a pond reflecting trees and sky, surrounded by green and yellow leaves and tall grass." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6af10c064c98a.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 23:55:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>布鲁斯·比斯利《交集2》</title><link>https://some.pics/6af10b0af07ae</link><description>&lt;p&gt;布鲁斯·比斯利的交叉2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A large angular metal sculpture tilted on a base among green bushes and trees under a clear blue sky." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6af10b0af07ae.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 23:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>六月满月</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0ddd821cff</link><description>&lt;p&gt;去年六月的满月&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a full moon shortly after nightfall, it's yellow/orange in color - someone's basketball hoop is in the foreground with a couple houses" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af0ddd821cff.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 20:38:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>印第安纳步行者队启程</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0dd558a959</link><description>&lt;p&gt;前往印第安纳&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='a toll plaza with 1960s neons that say "chicago skyway toll bridge" - it was taken right before sunrise' height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af0dd558a959.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 20:36:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>密歇根某地去年</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0dcca3561f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;去年在密歇根州的某个地方&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="some industrial tanks or buildings or something are painted in bright geometric designs next to a river" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af0dcca3561f.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 20:34:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Frost 🥶</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0d74d845da</link><description>&lt;p&gt;霜冻 🥶&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Frost on green grass in the early morning." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6af0d74d845da.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 20:10:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>恐怖图片分享</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0d0401a783</link><description>&lt;p&gt;还有一张那天的照片——刷屏了，因为我想给https://horror.some.pics稍微填充一下内容😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a view of the interstate and the skyline is visible above trees and buildings" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af0d0401a783.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:40:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>堵车时拍的照片</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0cfa5d2aa7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;又一张几个月前我堵车停下时拍的&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="an american airlines plane coming in to land - the sky is mostly cloudy" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af0cfa5d2aa7.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:38:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>安静的星期日</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0cc628cc24</link><description>&lt;p&gt;#静默星期天&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A two-lane road that passes under a bridge. The sun is setting, and the bridge and the trees lining the road stand out as black silhouettes against a yellow sky on the horizon. " height="2096" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6af0cc628cc24.jpg" width="2741"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:24:21 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>